			"othercredits"
			{
				"english"		"Music Producer: Austin Wintory\r\nMixing: Austin Wintory & Shireen Ghosh\r\nGuitars & bass: Tom Strahle\r\nFlutes, English horn, bass clarinet, ocarina, recorders, racket, tenor sax: Kristin Naigus\r\nDombra, violins: Dana Zulyphkar\r\nHurdy gurdy: Ashley Jarmack\r\nDrums & synth programming: Joris Hoogsteder"
				"french"		"Producteur musical : Austin Wintory\r\nMixage : Austin Wintory et Shireen Ghosh\r\nGuitares et basse : Tom Strahle\r\nFlûtes, cor anglais, clarinette basse, ocarina, flûtes à bec, ranquette, Saxophone ténor : Kristin Naigus\r\nDombra, violons : Dana Zulyphkar\r\nVielle à roue : Ashley Jarmack\r\nBatterie et programmation des synthétiseurs : Joris Hoogsteder"
				"italian"		"Produttore musicale: Austin Wintory\r\nMixaggio audio: Austin Wintory e Shireen Ghosh\r\nChitarre e basso: Tom Strahle\r\nFlauti, corno inglese, clarinetto basso, ocarina, flauti dolci, cervellato, sassofono tenore: Kristin Naigus\r\nDombra, violini: Dana Zulyphkar\r\nGhironda: Ashley Jarmack\r\nBatteria e programmazione sintetizzatore: Joris Hoogsteder"
